        {
            "id": "https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-switzerland/switzerland-train-pass-and-camping-trip-2021-day-one-zermatt-and-the-matterhorn-inc-4k-video/",
            "url": "https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-switzerland/switzerland-train-pass-and-camping-trip-2021-day-one-zermatt-and-the-matterhorn-inc-4k-video/",
            "title": "Switzerland Train Pass &amp; Camping Trip - 2021: Day One – Zermatt &amp; The Matterhorn (Inc. 4K Video)",
            "summary": "Photos and video from my 11 day trip to Switzerland in the&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Photos and video from my 11 day trip to Switzerland in the Autumn of 2021.<br><br>Day one (though in reality it’s day two after the first whole day of travelling!) and even though I’m extremely tired from the day before, I’m up super early after my first night camping into a seven day stay at Camping Hobby in Interlaken.<br><br>The Swiss weather report for cloud cover and blue skies in Zermatt look good and I have a 8 day Swiss Travel Pass (unlimited access on the network of Swiss Travel System for 8 days) so I head off to my first destination of Zermatt, then use the famous Gornegrat Railway to reach the summit of Gornegrat and check out the gorgeous views of the Matterhorn – enjoy the photos! 🙂</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-switzerland/media/posts/36//gallery/Beautiful-Switzerland-Trip-2021-Zermatt-and-The-Matterhorn-1.webp\" data-size=\"1024x767\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-switzerland/media/posts/36//gallery/Beautiful-Switzerland-Trip-2021-Zermatt-and-The-Matterhorn-1-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-switzerland/media/posts/36//gallery/Beautiful-Switzerland-Trip-2021-Zermatt-and-The-Matterhorn-1-2.webp\" data-size=\"1024x770\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-switzerland/media/posts/36//gallery/Beautiful-Switzerland-Trip-2021-Zermatt-and-The-Matterhorn-1-2-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"578\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://CarnabySnaps.github.io/travel-photography-switzerland/media/posts/36//gallery/Beautiful-Switzerland-Trip-2021-Zermatt-and-The-Matterhorn-1-3.we